.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The whole track library stays local. Two reasons, and the second is the
# important one:
#   1. Generated audio is large and reproducible from its recipe.
#   2. THE RECIPES EMBED THE LYRICS. This repo is public, so committing
#      tracks.json or a per-track .json would publish the author's unreleased
#      song text permanently and indexably. An earlier version of this file
#      un-ignored output/tracks.json to "keep the manifest" and would have done
#      exactly that. Do not re-add that exception.
output/
*.flac
*.mp3
*.opus
*.wav
